  description: The host's bloodhound. It does not patrol, it does not guard - it
    points its whole falling body at where you are and corrects.
  tactics: Tracks your horizontal position while descending - it will be above you.
    Its dive is the threat; sidestep late and it cannot correct in time. Killing
    it early spares you the pressure entirely.
